                "questionUz": "Qurʼoni Karimdagi eng uzun oyat qaysi va u nima haqida?",
                "publishedDate": "2026-11-01"
              },
              {
                "id": "q-034",
                "difficulty": "oson",
                "source": "Sahihi Buxoriy",
                "reference": "Manoqibus Sahoba kitobi, 3684-hadis",
                "optionsUz": [
                  "Hamza ibn Abdulmuttalib (r.a.)",
